Configuration keys a program reads straight from the environment through `Utils.read_env_var`, and how
many runs of it answer for each (gh-ocannl-749). A key read this way cannot be outranked by
a commandline flag or a config file, so every run depends on the variable unconditionally --
and EVERY one of them declares it or pins it with `setenv`, since dune invalidates each rule
on its own deps.
  OCANNL_DASHED_ONLY_KEY                 test/operations/dune, executable config_var_spellings (3 runs of config_var_spellings.exe)
  OCANNL_DEMO_KEY                        test/operations/dune, executable config_var_spellings (3 runs of config_var_spellings.exe)
  OCANNL_PROFILE                         test/operations/dune, test config_profiles (1 run of it)
  OCANNL_AUTOTUNE_BEAM_WIDTH             test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_AUTOTUNE_ROUNDS                 test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_AUTOTUNE_SEARCH                 test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_CC_BACKEND_ARCH_FLAGS           test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_CC_BACKEND_FAST_MATH            test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_CC_BACKEND_FP_CONTRACT          test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_CC_BACKEND_SIMD_FLAGS           test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_CC_VECTOR_BYTES                 test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_FP16_ARITHMETIC                 test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_MODEL_DEFAULT_SCHEDULE          test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_NO_CONFIG_FILE                  test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_TF32_MATMULS                    test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_TUNE_INLINE_FLIPS               test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_VIRTUALIZE_MAX_VISITS           test/operations/profiles/dune, executable profile_precedence (7 runs of profile_precedence.exe)
  OCANNL_LOG_CONFIG_SOURCING             test/operations/startup_streams/dune, executable startup_streams (5 runs of startup_streams.exe)
  OCANNL_LOG_LEVEL                       test/operations/startup_streams/dune, executable startup_streams (5 runs of startup_streams.exe)
  OCANNL_NO_CONFIG_FILE                  test/operations/startup_streams/dune, executable startup_streams (5 runs of startup_streams.exe)
